  "description": "Parquet files whose schema the steward's browser and the enclave must read alike (ADR 0014). `enclave` is what the enclave does with the file: `declares` the schema in `declared` with the footer's `rows`, or refuses it as `unreadable`, `no_family` (a column no type family covers) or `undeclarable` (a schema no declaration can hold). `browser` is `declares` (the same schema and rows) or the browser's refusal code. Every value in the files is a made-up literal. Generated by backend/crates/quackxide-engine/tests/parquet_schema_vectors.rs.",
